    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ooxudeiqahmxeyjcnfzneplvzsgntqmxsgievjfyjzgepgmpag.jpeg\"/><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>pKa</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math> will not change on dilution.<br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/dzzpwjwfoqzdartsqtzdziejvvvjeyrncftbfflkparqrhnabt.jpeg\"/><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.05</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.025</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/yydrhsjxojftvakhhijoheucyrlcosggumziuxiwzsxmulncrn.jpeg\"/><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msqrt></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Because of dilution, the solubility does not change. So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>constant</mi></math>.",
